   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "双十一抢购，你打开商品页，「猜你喜欢」那一栏一片空白。",
     "start": 0.0,
     "dur": 4.988
    },
    {
     "text": "可你照样下单、付款，一下就成功了。",
     "start": 5.268,
     "dur": 3.12
    },
    {
     "text": "这是出 bug 了吗？",
     "start": 8.668,
     "dur": 1.246
    }
   ]
  },
  "hook-2": {
   "start": 306,
   "duration": 275,
   "audioFrames": 265,
   "audioSec": 8.833,
   "chapter": "hook",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 306,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "其实不是，是网站故意这么做的。",
     "start": -0.006,
     "dur": 3.113
    },
    {
     "text": "它在保护你最要紧的那一步，我们先看看，要是不这么做，会发生什么。",
     "start": 3.387,
     "dur": 5.436
    }
   ]
  },
  "avalanche-1": {
   "start": 581,
   "duration": 245,
   "audioFrames": 236,
   "audioSec": 7.867,
   "chapter": "avalanche",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "商品页要展示推荐，就得去问推荐服务。",
     "start": 0.0,
     "dur": 3.599
    },
    {
     "text": "高峰时推荐服务卡住了，商品页就一直等着它。",
     "start": 3.879,
     "dur": 4.001
    }
   ]
  },
  "avalanche-2": {
   "start": 826,
   "duration": 385,
   "audioFrames": 375,
   "audioSec": 12.5,
   "chapter": "avalanche",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 245,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "等的人越积越多，商品页也跟着卡住，接着连下单服务都被拖慢。",
     "start": -0.007,
     "dur": 5.213
    },
    {
     "text": "一个服务出问题，一层层往上传，最后整个网站都崩了，这就叫雪崩。",
     "start": 5.486,
     "dur": 7.018
    }
   ]
  },
  "breaker-1": {
   "start": 1211,
   "duration": 259,
   "audioFrames": 251,
   "audioSec": 8.367,
   "chapter": "breaker",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "想想家里的电闸。",
     "start": 0.0,
     "dur": 1.604
    },
    {
     "text": "某个电器短路了，那一路的空气开关「啪」地跳下来，只断这一路，冰箱和灯照常用。",
     "start": 1.884,
     "dur": 6.467
    }
   ]
  },
  "breaker-2": {
   "start": 1470,
   "duration": 292,
   "audioFrames": 282,
   "audioSec": 9.4,
   "chapter": "breaker",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 259,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "网站也装了这样的开关：发现推荐服务老是出错，就先跳闸，不再去调用它，直接给个默认结果。",
     "start": -0.002,
     "dur": 7.997
    },
    {
     "text": "这就叫熔断。",
     "start": 8.275,
     "dur": 1.126
    }
   ]
  },
  "half-open-1": {
   "start": 1762,
   "duration": 251,
   "audioFrames": 243,
   "audioSec": 8.1,
   "chapter": "half-open",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "跳闸以后，也不能一直断着。",
     "start": 0.0,
     "dur": 2.401
    },
    {
     "text": "过一会儿，网站会先放一个请求过去试一试，这个状态叫半开。",
     "start": 2.681,
     "dur": 5.418
    }
   ]
  },
  "half-open-2": {
   "start": 2013,
   "duration": 368,
   "audioFrames": 358,
   "audioSec": 11.933,
   "chapter": "half-open",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 251,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "试成功了，说明推荐服务好了，就合上闸恢复调用；还是失败，就继续断开，过一阵再试。",
     "start": 0.012,
     "dur": 6.836
    },
    {
     "text": "另外每次调用都设个等待上限，叫超时，绝不死等。",
     "start": 7.128,
     "dur": 4.801
    }
   ]
  },
  "degrade-1": {
   "start": 2381,
   "duration": 257,
   "audioFrames": 248,
   "audioSec": 8.267,
   "chapter": "degrade",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "熔断是出了问题才跳闸。",
     "start": 0.0,
     "dur": 2.18
    },
    {
     "text": "还有一招是提前动手：用电紧张时，你会先关掉空调，保住冰箱。",
     "start": 2.46,
     "dur": 5.82
    }
   ]
  },
  "degrade-2": {
   "start": 2638,
   "duration": 388,
   "audioFrames": 378,
   "audioSec": 12.6,
   "chapter": "degrade",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 257,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "网站高峰时也一样，主动把推荐、评论这些可有可无的功能先关掉，猜你喜欢换成固定榜单，把力气留给下单和支付。",
     "start": -0.007,
     "dur": 10.247
    },
    {
     "text": "这就叫降级。",
     "start": 10.52,
     "dur": 2.09
    }
   ]
  },
  "recap-1": {
   "start": 3026,
   "duration": 608,
   "audioFrames": 599,
   "audioSec": 19.967,
   "chapter": "recap",
   "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
   "engine": "mimo",
   "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
   "voice": "冰糖",
   "gap": 0.28,
   "scale": 1,
   "provisional": false,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "简单说，熔断是出事后被动跳闸，降级是提前主动取舍，两招常常一起用。",
     "start": 0.0,
     "dur": 7.241
    },
    {
     "text": "再把扛住高峰四招放在一起：消息队列让订单排队不丢，限流守住门口，幂等保证只扣一次钱，熔断降级防止一个挂了全站都崩。",
     "start": 7.521,
     "dur": 12.452
    }
   ]
  },
